            "textSha256": "63ef427629a22812ff7e32b9df6abb7dbbf61142194131336391fa00c527d409"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, departure by 4x4 vehicle for a wildlife observation safari.\n\nYou will see tropical birds such as scarlet ibis, jabirus, herons, kites, and various species of turtles, iguanas, and capybaras. Later, join local guides for an anaconda tracking experience.\n\nReturn to the lodge and lunch.\n\nOptional: Evening safari in Los Llanos.\n\nMeals: breakfast, lunch, dinner"
